  "_comment": [
    "Closed-class vocabulary transcribed from the official AGLOA LinguiSHTIK",
    "materials for 2026-27. Automatic taggers are unreliable here and the",
    "Handbook publishes explicit lists, so these are maintained by hand.",
    "Sources: Handbook & Judges Manual 2026-27 -- III.D (pronouns) and the",
    "Personal Pronoun Chart III-24; VII.A 'Commonly Used Prepositions';",
    "VIII.A.1-2 subordinating conjunctions and conjunctive adverbs;",
    "IV.A.3 linking verbs; III.C.3 collective nouns (curated, see docs).",
    "Only words of 4-10 letters can ever be the word to be formed (LT 22 / LT 2),",
    "but shorter entries are kept so the analysis drills can reference them."
